      "path": "narration/s09-exercise/d507a93e1fe27163.wav",
      "sha256": "4eb469e8b42af52cb5c3c987f498ff93db758a2b9ead21e57121d35ca2d9c337",
      "fingerprint": "d507a93e1fe27163ab1ca2dc0ab83d188c0683e7b71222e222007aeb1ff2a93d",
      "cached": true,
      "duration_seconds": 46.712,
      "sample_rate": 48000,
      "channels": 1,
      "integrated_lufs": -20.1,
      "true_peak_dbtp": -1.7,
      "leading_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "trailing_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Here's an exercise for the next time you feel the urge to dismiss an argument.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.178
        },
        {
          "text": "First, name the contradiction. The belief…",
          "start": 5.128,
          "end": 7.557
        },
        {
          "text": "and the fact that challenges it.",
          "start": 8.057,
          "end": 9.875
        },
        {
          "text": "Be as specific as you can.",
          "start": 10.205,
          "end": 12.193
        },
        {
          "text": "Second, separate what happened from what you decided it means.",
          "start": 13.293,
          "end": 16.591
        },
        {
          "text": "I didn't get the job…",
          "start": 16.971,
          "end": 18.164
        },
        {
          "text": "is a fact. I'm not good enough…",
          "start": 18.664,
          "end": 20.501
        },
        {
          "text": "is an interpretation.",
          "start": 21.001,
          "end": 22.682
        },
        {
          "text": "Third, ask what being wrong would cost you.",
          "start": 23.532,
          "end": 25.478
        },
        {
          "text": "Your pride, your status, your years of effort?",
          "start": 26.028,
          "end": 28.543
        },
        {
          "text": "Fourth, decide what evidence would change your mind.",
          "start": 29.543,
          "end": 32.286
        },
        {
          "text": "And fifth, hold the evidence for and against your view to the same standard.",
          "start": 33.236,
          "end": 37.131
        },
        {
          "text": "You might still keep your belief, and that's fine.",
          "start": 38.231,
          "end": 40.743
        },
        {
          "text": "The point is that your confidence survived an examination…",
          "start": 41.243,
          "end": 44.582
        },
        {
          "text": "instead of avoiding one.",
          "start": 45.082,
          "end": 46.696
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "s10-question",
      "asset_id": "narr-s10-question",
      "route": "tts",
      "path": "narration/s10-question/7cdd294bbebbf9fb.wav",
      "sha256": "3ea46d806153e28faa87f52026958f63954f161e2283d2a50d40b7f4b123867c",
      "fingerprint": "7cdd294bbebbf9fb470bad7536fff6a4a959f2844d48b3f89cc5ae5b051be136",
      "cached": true,
      "duration_seconds": 52.278,
      "sample_rate": 48000,
      "channels": 1,
      "integrated_lufs": -20.0,
      "true_peak_dbtp": -2.4,
      "leading_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "trailing_silence_seconds": 0.0,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Here's the uncomfortable part. Being smart doesn't protect you.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.7
        },
        {
          "text": "The same skills that help you examine a belief…",
          "start": 4.12,
          "end": 6.871
        },
        {
          "text": "can help you build a better defence for it.",
          "start": 7.371,
          "end": 9.841
        },
        {
          "text": "But that's no reason for cynicism.",
          "start": 10.791,
          "end": 13.053
        },
        {
          "text": "People do change their minds.",
          "start": 13.673,
          "end": 15.119
        },
        {
          "text": "When the evidence is clear…",
          "start": 15.499,
          "end": 17.208
        },
        {
          "text": "and they have room to look at it honestly.",
          "start": 17.708,
          "end": 19.999
        },
        {
          "text": "So the goal isn't to never contradict yourself.",
          "start": 21.099,
          "end": 23.955
        },
        {
          "text": "It's to meet a contradiction…",
          "start": 24.375,
          "end": 26.195
        },
        {
          "text": "without treating it as an enemy.",
          "start": 26.695,
          "end": 28.688
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes the evidence is wrong.",
          "start": 29.538,
          "end": 31.779
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes the belief is wrong.",
          "start": 32.399,
          "end": 34.427
        },
        {
          "text": "And sometimes the belief is fine…",
          "start": 34.807,
          "end": 37.041
        },
        {
          "text": "but the story we built around it needs to change.",
          "start": 37.541,
          "end": 40.282
        },
        {
          "text": "So the next time reality disagrees with your story, ask yourself one question.",
          "start": 41.282,
          "end": 45.873
        },
        {
          "text": "Am I trying to understand what is true, or am I trying to preserve the person I believe myself to be?",
          "start": 46.293,
          "end": 52.26
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    }
  ],
